		{"id":"b2d197bb0bca1e10","type":"text","text":"[对数函数的图象和性质](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/知识点/对数函数的图象和性质.md)\n<table><tr><td>项目</td><td> 0＜a＜1 </td><td>a&gt;1</td></tr><tr><td>图象</td><td><img src=\"images/ef3e34b501db20b21fe3aab2a09c6734d9fdd0543445df968075a0d0c60eac31.jpg\"/></td><td><img src=\"images/547eab7fdf8df5a8489028af389fa9c5974c2c638dca6f20a33f395ac3cdd062.jpg\"/></td></tr><tr><td>定义域</td><td colspan=\"2\">(0,+∞)</td></tr><tr><td>值域</td><td colspan=\"2\">R</td></tr><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">性质</td><td colspan=\"2\">（1）过定点(1,0),即x=1时,y=0</td></tr><tr><td>（2）减函数</td><td>（2）增函数</td></tr></table>","x":-6012,"y":1705,"width":361,"height":390,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"4bfb45560e85f3a5","type":"text","text":"[对数函数的概念](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/知识点/对数函数的概念.md)\n-  $y=\\log_{a}x(a>0$ ，且 $a\\neq1)$\n- x 是自变量，定义域是 $(0,+\\infty)$","x":-6531,"y":1821,"width":300,"height":157,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"67987caaa81ca394","type":"text","text":"[对数的运算](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/知识点/对数的运算.md)\n1. $\\log_a(MN) = \\log_aM + \\log_aN;$   \n2. $\\log_a\\frac{M}{N} = \\log_aM - \\log_aN;$ \n3. $\\log_a M^n = n\\log_a M (n \\in \\mathbf{R})$ .\n4. $\\log_ {a} b = \\frac {\\log_ {c} b}{\\log_ {c} a} (a > 0, \\text {且} a \\neq 1; b > 0; c > 0, \\text {且} c \\neq 1).$","x":-7656,"y":1909,"width":405,"height":180,"color":"2"},
