		{"id":"dfb7c20e35ceb21a","type":"text","text":"[5.5 三角恒等变换](5.5%20三角恒等变换.md)","x":1707,"y":1029,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d849830d81efa2cb","type":"text","text":"[习题5.5 三角恒等变换](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/习题/习题5.5%20三角恒等变换.md)","x":4976,"y":1029,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"78db23fb7b7e1082","type":"text","text":"[辅助角公式](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/拓展知识点/辅助角公式.md)\n- $a\\sin x + b\\cos x = \\sqrt{a^2 + b^2} \\cdot \\sin(x + \\varphi)$\n  ,$\\quad \\sin\\varphi = \\frac{b}{\\sqrt{a^2 + b^2}}$","x":3510,"y":2249,"width":344,"height":120},
		{"id":"2a565fffd4379ffc","type":"text","text":"$\\tan 2 \\alpha = \\frac {2 \\tan \\alpha}{1 - \\tan^ {2} \\alpha}.(T_{2\\alpha})$","x":2888,"y":1535,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d6ec939554ac88bc","type":"text","text":"$\\sin 2 \\alpha = 2 \\sin \\alpha \\cos \\alpha ,(S_{2\\alpha})$","x":2888,"y":1185,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"bc86c8092e644904","type":"text","text":"$\\cos 2 \\alpha = \\cos^ {2} \\alpha - \\sin^ {2} \\alpha ,(C_{2\\alpha})$","x":2888,"y":1365,"width":250,"height":50},
		{"id":"041f55862c2d9155","type":"text","text":"[二倍角的正弦、余弦、正切公式](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/知识点/二倍角的正弦、余弦、正切公式.md)","x":3138,"y":1129,"width":276,"height":50,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"fe4562658592feba","type":"text","text":"任意角的三角函数转化为锐角三角函数：<div align=\"center\">\n  <img src=\"/课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/知识点/images/e6e99a1a61298e375080d4299bdaaed8b9795790d58c67cc476c4d48f12d82f4.jpg\" />\n</div>","x":697,"y":1477,"width":344,"height":240,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"158f464e70f9f454","type":"text","text":"[5.3 诱导公式](5.3%20诱导公式.md)\n- 奇变偶不变，符号看象限\n\n| **公式二：**<br>$$ \\boxed{ \\begin{aligned} \\sin (\\pi + \\alpha) &= - \\sin \\alpha,\\\\ \\cos (\\pi + \\alpha) &= - \\cos \\alpha,\\\\ \\tan (\\pi + \\alpha) &= \\tan \\alpha. \\end{aligned} } $$<br><br>**公式三：**<br>$$ \\boxed{ \\begin{aligned} \\sin(-\\alpha) &= -\\sin\\alpha,\\\\ \\cos(-\\alpha) &= \\cos\\alpha,\\\\ \\tan(-\\alpha) &= -\\tan\\alpha. \\end{aligned} } $$<br><br>**公式四：**<br>$$ \\boxed{ \\begin{aligned} \\sin(\\pi - \\alpha) &= \\sin\\alpha,\\\\ \\cos(\\pi - \\alpha) &= -\\cos\\alpha,\\\\ \\tan(\\pi - \\alpha) &= -\\tan\\alpha. \\end{aligned} } $$ | **公式五：**<br>$$ \\boxed{ \\begin{aligned} \\sin \\left(\\frac {\\pi}{2} - \\alpha\\right) &= \\cos \\alpha ,\\\\ \\cos \\left(\\frac {\\pi}{2} - \\alpha\\right) &= \\sin \\alpha . \\end{aligned} } $$<br><br>**公式六：**<br>$$ \\boxed{ \\begin{aligned} \\sin \\left(\\frac {\\pi}{2} + \\alpha\\right) &= \\cos \\alpha ,\\\\ \\cos \\left(\\frac {\\pi}{2} + \\alpha\\right) &= - \\sin \\alpha . \\end{aligned} } $$ |\n| :----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | :--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |\n","x":663,"y":838,"width":412,"height":586},
		{"id":"a1e35b82790c1233","type":"text","text":"$$\\sin \\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2} - \\alpha\\right) = -\\cos \\alpha ;$$$$\\cos \\left(\\frac{3\\pi}{2} + \\alpha\\right) = \\sin \\alpha.$$","x":1168,"y":944,"width":219,"height":143},
		{"id":"2850ee891ef861f2","type":"text","text":"[习题5.3 诱导公式](课本/【人教版】高中必修%20第一册数学电子课本/习题/习题5.3%20诱导公式.md)","x":1295,"y":744,"width":185,"height":60},
